# Stolen Stark Tech has flash: on Bot2's turn 2, with Lightning Bolt aimed at Savannah Lions on the stack, Bot1 casts it for exactly
# {1}{B}. Entering, it attaches to the Lions (a target chosen as the trigger goes on the stack), which gain indestructible until end
# of turn (CR 702.12b) and, equipped, get +1/+0 (3/1): the Bolt's 3 damage is lethal damage that destroys nothing, and the Lions
# are still there on turn 3, equipped, without the indestructible once the turn is over.

